loid of two sheets centered at $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-{x}_{0})^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-{y}_{0})^{2}}{{b}^{2}}-\\frac{(z-{z}_{0})^{2}}{{c}^{2}}=-1,\n$$\n\nThus, our equation is a hyperboloid of two sheets with the following parameters:\n\n$$\n({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})=(-1,0,2),\\,a=\\sqrt{3},\\,b=2,\\,c=1.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401503 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401504 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401503 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401505 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401503 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401506 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401503 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401507 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401503 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401508 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401503 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401503 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401503 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186401504 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401503 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "25021911-f878-5c6e-8755-61db8e40936f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401504 #edb/ref 1080 "A hyperboloid of two sheets" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401504 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401504 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "917478a6-9f85-5c2f-9abc-0e94e7aaed04" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401505 #edb/ref 1080 "An elliptic cone" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401505 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401505 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1549a164-9e45-5667-87ff-e1b8a78bcfbb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401506 #edb/ref 1080 "A hyperboloid of one sheet" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401506 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401506 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2993d1fe-f7db-55c9-8175-8657b7efaf2a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401507 #edb/ref 1080 "A hyperbolic cylinder" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401507 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045